sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 👤 用户查询
    participant API as getCounts 方法
    participant Check1 as 退避检查
    participant RateLimit as 限流器
    participant Lock as Redisson 分布式锁
    participant Bitmap as Bitmap 分片
    participant HashHash 聚合桶
    participant SDS as SDS 计数

    User->>API: 请求知文 123 的计数
    API->>API: 读取 SDS
    Note over API: SDS 不存在或损坏<br/>needRebuild = true

    API->>Check1: inBackoff?
    Check1-->>API: false (不在退避期)

    API->>RateLimit: tryAcquire(1)
    RateLimit-->>API: true (允许重建)

    API->>Lock: tryLock(0ms)
    Lock-->>API: true (获得锁)

    loop 对每个指标 (like, fav)
        API->>Bitmap: bitCountShardsPipelined()
        Note over Bitmap: 扫描所有分片<br/>bm:like:knowpost:123:*
        Bitmap-->>API: 返回总和<br/>like=1000, fav=500
    end

    API->>API: 组装新 SDS<br/>20 字节二进制串
    API->>SDS: setRaw(cntKey, newSds)
    Note over SDS: ✅ SDS 重建完成

    API->>Hash: delete(aggKey, ["1", "2"])
    Note over Hash: 清理聚合桶<br/>避免重复加算

    API->>Check1: resetBackoff()
    Note over Check1: 重置退避状态

    API->>Lock: unlock()
    Lock-->>API: 释放锁

    API-->>User: 返回计数<br/>{like=1000, fav=500}